#: ../../source/getting-started/installation.rst:2
msgid "Install Daedalus Studio"
msgstr "安装 Daedalus Studio"

#: ../../source/getting-started/installation.rst:5
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "系统要求"

#: ../../source/getting-started/installation.rst:7
msgid ""
"The supported desktop target is Windows 10 or Windows 11 on x64. To use "
"the full Godot integration, install Godot 4.5 or newer as well."
msgstr "支持的桌面系统是 x64 版本的 Windows 10 或 Windows 11。要使用完整的 Godot 集成，还需要安装 Godot 4.5 或更高版本。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/installation.rst:10
msgid ""
"You also need an account and API key for at least one model provider "
"before you can run an AI conversation. The provider may be one of the "
"built-in providers or a compatible custom provider."
msgstr "在运行 AI 对话前，你还需要至少一个模型供应商的账号和 API key。供应商可以是内置供应商，也可以是兼容的自定义供应商。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/installation.rst:15
msgid "Download and install"
msgstr "下载并安装"

#: ../../source/getting-started/installation.rst:17
msgid ""
"Download the latest Studio installer from the `Daedalus Studio releases "
"page <https://github.com/LuYingYiLong/daedalus-studio/releases/latest>`_."
msgstr "从 `Daedalus Studio releases page <https://github.com/LuYingYiLong/daedalus-studio/releases/latest>`_ 下载最新的 Studio 安装程序。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/installation.rst:20
msgid "Run ``Daedalus-Studio-Setup-<version>.exe``."
msgstr "运行 ``Daedalus-Studio-Setup-<version>.exe``。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/installation.rst:21
msgid ""
"Launch Studio and wait for the first startup check to finish. Studio "
"verifies and installs the bundled backend as part of this process."
msgstr "启动 Studio，并等待首次启动检查完成。Studio 会在此过程中验证并安装随附的后端。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/installation.rst:23
msgid "Continue through the setup wizard described in :doc:`first-run`."
msgstr "继续完成 :doc:`first-run` 中介绍的设置向导。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/installation.rst:26
msgid ""
"Studio manages the backend it ships with. A normal installation does not "
"require a global Node.js or npm installation."
msgstr "Studio 会管理随附的后端。普通安装不需要全局安装 Node.js 或 npm。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/installation.rst:30
msgid "Where data is stored"
msgstr "数据存储位置"

#: ../../source/getting-started/installation.rst:32
msgid ""
"Studio keeps application window preferences in Electron's user-data "
"directory. Daedalus runtime data is stored under::"
msgstr "Studio 会将应用窗口偏好设置保存在 Electron 的 user-data 目录中。Daedalus 运行时数据保存在："

#: ../../source/getting-started/installation.rst:37
msgid ""
"This directory can contain sessions, attachments, logs, workspace "
"settings, provider metadata, and personal Skills. API keys are stored "
"through the operating-system credential store rather than in ordinary "
"Daedalus JSON configuration."
msgstr "此目录可能包含会话、附件、日志、工作区设置、供应商元数据和个人 Skill。API key 会通过操作系统凭据存储保存，而不会写入普通的 Daedalus JSON 配置。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/installation.rst:42
msgid ""
"Treat this directory as private. See :doc:`../reference/privacy` before "
"sharing diagnostics or backups."
msgstr "请将此目录视为私密数据。在分享诊断信息或备份前，请参阅 :doc:`../reference/privacy`。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/installation.rst:46
msgid "Updates and compatibility"
msgstr "更新与兼容性"

#: ../../source/getting-started/installation.rst:48
msgid ""
"Use Studio's own update flow when it offers an update. Studio checks the "
"compatibility of the desktop client, backend, and Godot Bridge before "
"startup; if a managed component is unhealthy, it can repair or roll back "
"the component instead of silently continuing with an incompatible "
"version."
msgstr "Studio 提供更新时，请使用 Studio 自带的更新流程。Studio 会在启动前检查桌面客户端、后端和 Godot Bridge 的兼容性；如果托管组件不健康，它可以修复或回滚该组件，而不是默默使用不兼容的版本继续运行。"
